        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-19T20:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've found that his side A advanced mode is just about the right speed to keep the pressure high and the players on their toes. However, once he flips he is pretty terrible.</p><p>My house rule is on his side B he hits both the highest and lowest hero for H damage (Instead of just the highest). This makes him&nbsp;harder without making him impossible.</p>",
